 "note": "THOMAS C. PASSIOS ELEMENTARY SCHOOL FACULTY/STAFF 2009-2010 printed at line 1 (grades 3-5). Lines 63-70 begin the Turkey Hill Middle School narrative (names in it are not roster lines); line 71 is the page number. Two columns: the left column (OFFICE, GRADE 3-5) always prints role and name on one line, so a name alone on a line is the right column (SPECIAL AREAS, then SPECIAL SERVICES). A right-column role label is printed once above its group (Art, Health/PE, Music, Learning Center, Learning Center Tutor, Learning Assistant, Achieve Assistant, Custodian, Cafeteria): the label printed with the first name is that person's role_raw; later names in the group carry it in role_raw where it is a job title or in grade_or_dept where it is a subject (Art, Health/PE, Music, Cafeteria). Custodians and cafeteria at lines 57-62 sit after SPECIAL SERVICES with no heading of their own; Custodian/Cafeteria printed with the first name; custodians get an empty grade_or_dept. 'Toni Wuchterl', Achieve Assistants after Julie Drake, and 'Jim Vaillancourt' take the role printed above them."
